      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it feels a little plain. i think it needs a bit more \"emotional weight\" to really move people. \n\nthe campaign manager just ran this through the tool and the score came back pretty low. they're saying it's not \"vibrant\" enough to pass the screening. i know i said don't go overboard, but we really need that score to be higher so it doesn't get rejected immediately by the system. \n\ncan you try a second version? maybe try to incorporate more evocative, descriptive language to bump up that adjective density, but try to keep it from being totally unreadable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
